WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.000
Jupiter is pulsing with unlimited energy.

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:10.230
Having wrested control of Za Powa, the 31 Machine Primevals...

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.830
...launched their final program, the Z-Master...

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:17.570
...and blasted Earth with Zonder spores, the seeds of mechanization!

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.510
Africa, positioned just below the ES Window...

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.610
...has already been completely Zonderized.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:27.420
The Western Hemisphere's network is also about to be cut off.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.920
The entire planet will be Zonderized in approximately 170 minutes!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.650
If only we could use Disc X!

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:35.130
Time is running out.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.520
Even if we had Disc X, we'd have no hope of catching up.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:42.730
There's nothing we can do but put our faith in our brave heroes.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.470
Mamoru...

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:59.230
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:02.130
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:08.830
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.750
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:19.980
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:24.070
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:28.770
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:32.730
It's time to launch!

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.910
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:39.830
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:44.530
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.490
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:50.410
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.160
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:56.670
Pulverizing steel!

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:00.340
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:07.870
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:13.870
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:16.690
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:20.870
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:24.800
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:27.930
Ending the Mechanization Threat

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:31.120
<i>Ending the Mechanization Threat</i>

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.680
The Z-Master's advance is being manipulated...

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.620
...by the Heart Primeval in its center!

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.320
If you can target that spot...

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:44.050
We can win!

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:48.420
10-linked Maser Cannons! Antimeson Cannons! Simultaneous Barrage!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.790
Blow, ice and snow! Split the sky, lightning!

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.470
Thunder Blizzard!

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:58.130
Roar, Hurricane! Burn, scorching heat!

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.570
Burning Hurricane!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.240
Reflector Beam, launch!

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.580
Solitary Wave...

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:10.240
Fire!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.320
There's no effect at all!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.290
O, you weak-willed souls...

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:27.490
How long do you think you can keep up this futile fight?

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.320
Damage level, zero!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.170
Is it some kind of barrier?

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:30.840
No...

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.900
It's just that its total energy level is incomparably high.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.740
It's like trying to melt sugar cubes in the ocean.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.010
So this enemy's not so sweet, huh?

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.810
Swan! You've got to measure the Z-Master's energy level!

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:43.440
Okay!

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.630
It's going to attack us!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.790
Generating Armor, maximum output!

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.440
Protect Wall!

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.200
It's no good! You can't hold it back!

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.310
Withdraw at top speed!

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:16.780
Volfogg!

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:21.650
Three Become One!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:28.050
I wonder how long you can withstand this assault?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.930
Main Power Reactor damaged!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.400
All independent interface system's output down by 39%!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.970
Hey, GaoGaiGar! Remember when we defeated the Combined Primeval?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.980
Let's use that Gravity Lens again!

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:44.840
All right!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.510
Izanagi, launch the Gatling Driver!

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.550
Let's do it, my brothers!

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:56.690
Yeah!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.020
Gatling Driver!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.830
Let's go, Mic Brigade!

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.990
That's all right!

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.400
Warp space!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.900
Solitary Wave...

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:11.730
Fire!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.710
Create Gravity Lens!

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:29.420
Oh, but we remember that attack!

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:41.590
You fools, the same tactic isn't going to work again!

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:47.740
The Solitary Wave...

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:48.970
...he's deflecting it back!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.010
Impossible!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.270
Run, everybody!

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.450
Withdraw at top speed!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:00.580
My brothers!

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:14.130
N-No way!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:15.460
The Mic Brigade...

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.400
Hang in there, First!

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.000
Don't die on me! You can't die on me!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:26.850
First! Stay with me, First!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:33.080
No... no... you're gonna pay for this.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.680
I'll make you pay for this, Z-Master!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:42.590
I can sense it now. A violent surge of hatred and rage...

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:48.730
You are the source of overflowing negative energy!

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:52.900
It is you who shall drive the universe into chaos!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.640
You shall be destroyed!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.310
To cry and struggle to survive, that is the essence of life!

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:02.040
I'm going to give you a good look at the struggle of those who still live!

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.580
J-Quath!

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:19.800
What's the matter, King J-Der?

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.990
Surely that's not the best you can do?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.240
But this flow of energy...

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.970
Mechanization is a necessary step for evolution.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:35.040
Those who refuse to accept this process...

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.810
...who continue to emit negative energy...

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:43.520
...thereby forfeit the right to co-exist in this universe.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:49.930
King J-Der!

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:52.360
Now you shall be destroyed!

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:05.370
The brave heroes!

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.280
Chief!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:14.590
The Z-Master is able to sustain its offensive and defensive power...

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:17.350
...because it's incorporated Za Powa!

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:21.590
The Z-Master appears to be absorbing Za Powa...

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.960
...through that section connected to Jupiter!

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:28.530
Za Powa is being absorbed from Jupiter's core, and the Z-Master...

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:33.060
...is using its heart to dispense the energy to all areas of its body!

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.860
In other words...

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.420
What's this?

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:45.710
It's Za Powa!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:48.250
And it's unbelievably concentrated.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.780
So this is the force of Za Powa?

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.380
I see...

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.230
If they can somehow get onto the flow of Za Powa...

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.270
...they can ride their way inside the Z-Master...

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.770
...and launch an assault on its heart?

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.140
Yes.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.490
However...

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:08.010
I know it's a do-or-die move.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.100
Gai!

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:12.370
But if we're going to defeat the Z-Master there's no other way!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:13.970
If we hesitate now...

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:16.850
...how are we ever going to face Dad and our other dead comrades?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:21.280
If that's our only hope then we've got to take this risk!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.920
We've got to believe...

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.150
...in victory!

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:25.790
Gai...

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.130
All right.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.630
The survival of all living things in the universe...

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.670
...is now in your hands, brave heroes!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.230
I have only one command for you.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.700
Come back alive!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.530
That's all.

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.460
Let's go, everybody!

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:43.500
Roger!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:44.610
Right!

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:45.870
Roger, Captain!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:46.970
Hey!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.010
We're gonna win this!

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.180
We're gonna destroy the Z-Master!

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:09.170
J-Ark!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.400
Brave Warriors! Climb aboard!

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:19.830
We're counting on you!

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:23.380
We're going to plunge inside the Z-Master with the J-Ark on full power.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:24.810
Kaidou...

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:27.750
To destroy the Z-Master...

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:31.220
That's the one reason we've stayed alive all this time.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.050
Come on, brave heroes!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.160
Right!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:44.830
To be annihilated is the fate of civilization.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:52.940
Evade at top speed!

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.980
No! It got Izanagi!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.820
Oh, boy! That was a close shave!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:06.860
So you're not dead yet?

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:17.060
The J-Ark and the GGG Brigade... they've infiltrated the Z-Master!

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:20.640
All right! Start the rescue mission to get Izanagi out of there!

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:21.670
Roger!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.430
It's the Brain Primeval!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.260
All 31 of the Primevals are here in one place, right?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.410
They're not going to get their way!

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.110
Go on ahead.

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:03.340
Before they finish the mechanization process on Earth...

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.780
...we've got to destroy the Heart Primeval.

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.740
You can leave this one to me.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:08.750
But...

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.620
It's all for the sake of defeating the Z-Master!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:13.360
All right.

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.890
Come on, everybody, we're heading for its heart!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.050
Right!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:18.930
Kaidou...

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:29.930
It's the Ear Primeval!

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:33.270
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.970
Big Volfogg!

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:40.250
GaoGaiGar, please hurry on ahead.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.290
Sorry. I'm counting on you!

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:44.320
Please don't die.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.020
Big Volfogg!

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:48.030
Of course I won't, Special Agent Mamoru...

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.360
Whirling Death Strike!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.860
I won't let you go!

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:03.730
It's the Nose Primeval!

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:08.610
Jiao Dan Ji!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:12.870
GouRyuJin!

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:15.580
My brother, look after the Captain and the others!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.460
Melting Rifle!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.420
GouRyuJin!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:27.330
Let us go, Captain. That is our mission, after all.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:29.730
Right.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:36.830
My brother...

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:47.010
Solitary Wave!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.180
Just leave this one to me!

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:57.520
I'm going to show him the real power of my Solitary Wave!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.990
Okay. I'm counting on you, Mic!

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.930
Mic!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:08.170
Just watch me, my brothers. The 13th is going into battle for all of you!

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.710
We're almost at the heart!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.710
It's the Spine Primeval!

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.680
Freezing Rifle!

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.230
GenRyuJin!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.160
Captain, go ahead and infiltrate its heart.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:35.130
If you Purify the core, victory will be ours!

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:37.070
I believe that we'll win.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.200
GenRyuJin!

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:52.250
GaoGaiGar will reach the heart in another 2,000...

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:56.950
GaoGaiGar, let's go kick that thing to oblivion!

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:57.920
All right!

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:58.820
Here it comes!

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:00.220
It's the Lung Primeval and the Ear Primeval!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:06.130
Goldion Hammer!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.260
Curse you all!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.230
Transform into Light!

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:18.440
There's the heart right there!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.340
Let's go!

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.750
That's it! That's the Heart Primeval!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:39.860
Okay!

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:51.270
Negative energy shall bring outer space to destruction.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:56.210
All living things are bound to be mechanized into Zonders...

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:59.840
...which harbor no negative energy.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.560
Can't move...

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.530
Don't tell me you still don't see it!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:15.460
King J-Der!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:20.100
What you call negative energy is the very thing that proves you're alive!

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:22.740
There's no life without it!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:28.070
That's precisely why life-forms should fuse with machines...

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:31.040
...and move on to the next dimension.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.820
Big Volfogg!

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.520
And GenRyuJin! GouRyuJin!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.590
Brave heroes! You've got to puncture the Z-Master's vein!

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.060
His vein?

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:52.140
I shall enter his heart and destroy him.

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:56.100
That vein is his Achilles heel as well as his weapon!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:57.540
Come on!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.080
King J-Der!

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:05.010
Blow, Ice and Snow! Split the sky, Lightning!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.680
Roar, Hurricane! Burn, scorching heat!

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.320
Maximum Tou Long!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.730
Hah! Not so fast!

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:18.950
Mic!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.460
Melting Siren!

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:26.090
I won't let everybody's powers go to waste!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.540
Goldion Hammer!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:38.740
It's not mechanization that this universe needs!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.610
It's our burning courage!

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:43.250
And if you want to keep calling it "negative energy"...

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.550
...then it's you who should be destroyed, Z-Master!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.630
It's you, not us!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.630
Well done, GaoGaiGar!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.230
What do you think you're doing?

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.640
Za Powa isn't the power of destruction after all.

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:07.310
How foolish of us to forget that!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.510
Za Powa, maximum output!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:30.430
His homeland was destroyed in the flames of war.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:30.430
Furusato wa horobi no senka ni chitta

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.990
B-But this...

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:42.010
There is no longer a planet to which he can return, in this indifferent galaxy.

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:42.010
Kaeru hoshi ni naki kokou no ginga

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.230
Za Powa...

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:37.210
...the infinite energy flowing from the enemy's heart...

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:43.370
...is now sending the Z-Master to the very brink of absolute destruction!

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:54.410
All the suffering and tears of this warrior have now been exhausted.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:54.410
Kanashimi mo namida mo karehateta senshi

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:48.850
J!

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:52.180
Gai, we'll settle our score someday.

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.890
Make sure you survive!

00:18:54.850 --> 00:19:06.950
His noble blood begins to roar, spreading its wings.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:19:06.950
Kedakaki chi wa hoeru tsubasa wo hirogete

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:57.650
Kaidou!

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.730
Latio...

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:02.760
Now that it's come to this, we cannot stop the flow of Za Powa.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.070
Release your powers and escape now.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:07.230
But what about you?

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:10.430
Don't worry. Look after our friends on Earth.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:18.100
Ute Ute Ute Ute omae no teki wo

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:18.100
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire on your enemy!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:13.740
Okay! But don't you die on me, either, Kaidou!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:15.410
Thank you...

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.580
My friend from Earth...

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:30.620
Break in! Break in! Break through! Break through the limits of your own existence!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:30.620
Kudake Kudake Kudake Kudake inochi no kagiri ni

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.040
J...

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:24.350
Arma...

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:28.020
The three of us will be together until the end.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:31.630
This means that we'll have achieved our goal.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:37.020
Super battleship,

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:37.020
Choudokyuu senkan

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.370
Mother...

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:41.850
I would like to fight with you.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:41.850
omae to tomo ni tatakau

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:47.520
Super battleship,

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:47.520
Choudokyuu senkan

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:52.990
your human form

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:52.990
oshiki sono sugata wa

00:19:52.990 --> 00:20:08.460
is the lord of space!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:20:08.460
uchuu no ouja

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:01.150
You have destroyed me.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.730
However...

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:18.640
Z-Master, zero energy levels detected.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.440
Annihilation confirmed!

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:23.710
What about the brave heroes?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.800
They're alive. Our heroes are alive and well!

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:47.060
Gai...

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.740
Two powers become one...

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.980
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo...

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.190
Vitas!

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:18.230
Mamoru...

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:31.770
The universe...

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:34.410
...has been saved!

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:48.150
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:52.290
The great battle waged by our Brave Warriors is now over.

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:56.380
However, a cruel destiny still awaits someone in this story.

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.860
We all must come to the end of our lives someday.

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:03.970
But as living beings we must never lose sight of the way to survive.

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:06.630
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:06.510
Life

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:07.870
"Life"

00:24:07.940 --> 00:24:11.000
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.250 --> 00:24:15.250
Mamoru Amami

00:24:13.110 --> 00:24:14.750
This is the Key to Victory!
